{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
'''Group E of the [[2002 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place on 11 June 2002. [[Germany national football team|Germany]] won the group, and advanced to the second round, along with [[Republic of Ireland national football team|the Republic of Ireland]]. [[Cameroon national football team|Cameroon]] and [[Saudi Arabia national football team|Saudi Arabia]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |last=Manaschev |first=Erlan |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/2002full.html |title=World Cup 2002 – Match Details |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |date=3 July 2008 |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

