*Germany advanced to play Paraguay (runner-up of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group B|Group B]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Germany vs Paraguay|round of 16]].
*Republic of Ireland advanced to play Spain (winner of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group B|Group B]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Spain vs Republic of Ireland|round of 16]].

